                                "sense_id": "9038c4be-1b9d-3f8b-85ad-3f1e102948ca",
                                "text": "But what of the beginnings—to come back to the question—the first stirrings in the biological twiglet of evolution, when that splendid solid-state apparatus had not yet developed and a few smallish organic molecules were all that was?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d0885af-8110-4022-a79c-59cd0cb8a8b1",
                                "sense_id": "9038c4be-1b9d-3f8b-85ad-3f1e102948ca",
                                "text": "She pushed her glasses back up to the bridge of her nose and leaned back on her twiglet arms."
                            }
                        ]
